  "description": "Skaters line up in the corner. One at a time, skate around the top of the first face-off circle, cut across the slot to the bottom of the second circle and go all the way around it, like a figure 8. Keep going up the boards and loop around the face-off dot past the blue line. The coach passes you a puck; skate in and shoot. The next skater goes when the one ahead reaches the second circle, so skaters cross in the slot.",
